controls.tooltip:
Push · sculpt.push · {chord}
Pushes the surface out along its normal.
Ctrl: push in · Shift: smooth

Inflate · sculpt.inflate · {chord}
Swells the surface along each point's own normal.
Ctrl: deflate · Shift: smooth

Fold · sculpt.fold · {chord}
Folds the surface into a hill and a valley.
Ctrl: bump with a trough · Shift: smooth

Clay · sculpt.clay · {chord}
Builds the surface up to a set level.
Ctrl: cut down to the level · Shift: smooth

Smooth · sculpt.smooth · {chord}
Relaxes the surface.
Ctrl: keep volume · Shift: smooth

Smudge · sculpt.smudge · {chord}
Drags points along with the brush, smearing the surface.
Ctrl: slide the other way · Shift: smooth

Carve · sculpt.carve · {chord}
Pushes points sharply inward.
Ctrl: raise a ridge · Shift: smooth

Scar · sculpt.scar · {chord}
Cuts a pinched gash into the surface.
Ctrl: raised welt · Shift: smooth

Flatten · sculpt.flatten · {chord}
Flattens the surface to a plane.
Ctrl: push up · Shift: smooth

Emboss · sculpt.emboss · {chord}
Moves the area under the brush in or out along its normals by a set amount.
Ctrl: reverse direction · Shift: smooth

Attenuate · sculpt.shrink · {chord}
Fades stored sculpt detail back toward the unsculpted shape.
Ctrl: nothing · Shift: smooth

Spin · sculpt.spin · {chord}
Swirls points around the brush centre.
Ctrl: spin the other way · Shift: smooth

Move · sculpt.move · {chord}
Grabs the surface under the brush and drags it.
Ctrl: opposite direction · Shift: smooth

Paint · sculpt.vmapPaint · {chord}
Raises the selected weight map toward 100 %.
Ctrl: lower toward 0 · Shift: smooth

Smooth · sculpt.vmapSmooth · {chord}
Blurs the selected weight map's values.
Ctrl: sharpen · Shift: smooth

Scale Down · sculpt.vmapScale · {chord}
Pulls the selected weight map's values toward 0.
Ctrl: scale up · Shift: smooth

Erase · sculpt.vmapErase · {chord}
Removes the selected weight map's values.
Ctrl: erase · Shift: smooth

Set Value · sculpt.vmapSetVal · {chord}
Writes exactly Value into the selected weight map.
Ctrl: erase · Shift: smooth
